  "question": {
    "text": "If the domain of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>]</mo></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>α</mi></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
