  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, using the definition of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi></math> function and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> function we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p> </p><p>Now, solving <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> we get,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/776375c9-fbd1-4cd2-83d9-8d67d158cbe6.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 50px;\"/></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>∪</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Similarly for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>∞</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>∪</mo><mfenced open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, taking intersection of  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>∩</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>∩</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p><p>So, on comparing with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>]</mo></math> we get, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo>&amp;</mo><mo> </mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
